  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 220 °C and line a baking sheet with parchment.",
    "Cut the carrots diagonally into pieces of about 4 cm, halving thick ones lengthwise.",
    "Whisk 1 tbsp balsamic, 1 tbsp honey and the oil, pour over the carrots, add garlic, thyme, salt and pepper and toss.",
    "Lift the carrots onto the tray, keeping the liquid. Roast 20–25 minutes, brushing with the reserved liquid for the last 5–10 minutes.",
    "Drizzle with the remaining balsamic and honey mixed together, toss, and serve with the goat cheese."
  ]
